#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""Answer the assistant on GitHub, mirror its Linear tickets to GitHub, and answer its
Linear tickets for Claude.

Each run takes three ordered, independent steps:

A. answer new open GitHub issue and pull-request conversation items by the assistant once
   (a pull request's own body is not a question);
B. mirror configured-team tickets labelled for:assistant into GitHub issues, including later field
   changes and comments, and close completed mirrors;
C. acknowledge or answer configured-team tickets carrying both for:claude and from:assistant;
   off since 2026-10-10 (the dispatcher works for:claude tickets on the laptop and posts
   its own Starting comment), re-enabled with BRIDGE_ACK_FOR_CLAUDE=1.
"""

